sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster Admin
    participant CLI as rhai-cli<br/>kubectl plugin
    participant RBAC as SelfSubjectAccessReview
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>Subscriptions & CSVs
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>TrustYAI discovery
    participant TrustYAI as TrustYAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+ (InsecureSkipVerify)
    participant MCPClient as AI Agent<br/>(MCP Client)

    Note over User, K8sAPI: Flow 1: Standard Kubernetes Operations (status, get, lint, diagnose)
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli status / get / lint
    CLI->>CLI: Resolve kubeconfig<br/>(ConfigFlags: --kubeconfig, --context, --token)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Discovery + dynamic client requests<br/>Auth: bearer token / client cert / OIDC
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Resource state (pods, deployments, CRDs)
    CLI-->>User: Formatted output (table/JSON)

    Note over User, OLM: Flow 2: Operator Lifecycle Inspection
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli deps / diagnose
    CLI->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview pre-flight check
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Allowed / Denied
    CLI->>OLM: List Subscriptions, CSVs
    OLM-->>CLI: Operator lifecycle state
    CLI->>CLI: clusterhealth assessment +<br/>failureclassifier categorization
    CLI-->>User: Diagnostics report with failure classification

    Note over User, TrustYAI: Flow 3: TrustYAI Migration
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli migrate trustyai backup
    CLI->>RBAC: SelfSubjectAccessReview pre-flight
    RBAC-->>CLI: Authorized
    CLI->>Route: Lookup TrustYAI Route (by label/name)
    Route-->>CLI: Route host URL
    CLI->>TrustYAI: GET /metrics (backup)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token from kubeconfig<br/>TLS 1.2+ InsecureSkipVerify=true
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Metrics data
    CLI-->>User: Backup file saved

    User->>CLI: rhai-cli migrate trustyai restore
    CLI->>TrustYAI: POST /metrics (restore)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS 1.2+ InsecureSkipVerify=true
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Restore confirmation
    CLI-->>User: Restore complete

    Note over MCPClient, CLI: Flow 4: MCP Server Mode (SSE transport)
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli mcp serve --transport=sse
    CLI->>CLI: Start HTTP server on localhost:8080
    MCPClient->>CLI: GET /sse<br/>JSON-RPC tool call
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Execute CLI operation
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Result
    CLI-->>MCPClient: SSE event with JSON-RPC response
